杂种，和诸葛家正宗血统的人是不一样的……”短发少年脸色一变，刚要提醒微胖的少年悠着点，好歹对方还是姓诸葛的。刚想开口，就只觉得眼前一花，一道人影闪过。短发少年目瞪口呆的看着眼前的一幕。他们口中的鸡窝头飞身而起，在离他们三米远的地方猛的跺脚借力，整个人飞身而起，一双脚狠狠的踩在了微胖少年的脸上。巨大的冲力轰然而至，直接将微胖少年踢的鼻血飞溅，咚的倒在地上。然后，诸葛明月优雅落地，回头，冲短发少年灿烂一笑。短发少年瞬间看呆了。这是平时那个唯唯诺诺的鸡窝头？这是么？插瞎他的双眼他也不信啊！一头杂乱的头发现在梳理的极为柔顺，披在身后，额头和眼睛露了出来。光洁的额头下面，一双修长的漂亮眉毛，眉毛下是让人心悸的晶亮眸子。眉间的飞扬犹如绚烂的阳光，让人睁不开眼。小巧的嘴唇微微上翘，正在对着他笑。“诸葛，诸葛明月……”短发少年良久才回过神来，喃喃的叫出声。诸葛明月没有理会他，而是在微胖少年的面前蹲了下来，巧笑倩兮：“胖子，你刚才说我什么？再重复一遍，可好？”“啊，啊……”微胖的少年一抬头就对上这张明艳的脸，心神荡漾后鼻血流的更厉害了，下意识的就老实回答，“说，说杂种就是杂种……”白痴！短发少年扶住自己的额头，很想晕倒。“哦，这样啊。”诸葛明月笑的更为灿烂了，缓缓起身。“你，你是诸葛明月，原来你这样，这样漂亮啊……”微胖少年还没意识到接下来他要面对的是什么，而是痴痴的看着诸葛明月，喃喃的说道。“是啊，我就是诸葛明月。”诸葛明月微笑着点头，下一刻，脸色却大变，狠狠抬脚，踩！踩死你这个胖子，让你变成死胖子！最恨人说我杂种！踩死你！“敢说我是杂种，去死！去死！去死！”“啊啊啊啊啊，呀呀呀呀呀，喔喔喔喔喔喔喔……”微胖的少年被踩的滚过来滚过去，然后不停的嚎叫着。短发少年抽搐着嘴角，狠狠的吞了一口吐沫，下意识的往后退了两步。太可怕了，太惨绝人寰了！平时看起来人畜无害的诸葛明月爆发起来原来是这样的恐怖？！还有，胖子，你挨打要不要叫的这么销魂啊？不知道的人还以为你怎么了呢。踩完了人，诸葛明月收脚，看着地上已经昏迷过去的胖子，哼了声，优雅的理了理自己耳边的发，转身，离去。那短发的少年等诸葛明月走远了，才小心蹲下来，伸手摇了摇地上的人：“胖子，还活着没？死了没？”“……”胖子沉默。“死了没？死了我去你家报丧买棺材啊。”短发少年伸出手使劲的摇了摇地上的胖子。“我死了，我真的死了……我死了……”胖子吃力的爬起来，看着诸葛明月远去的背影，捂着自己的胸口，喃喃的说道，“怎么办？子皓，我死了。”“我看你是傻了！”那叫薛子皓的少年，伸手不客气拍的一掌打在了胖子的头上，“你还知道你是谁不？”“我当然知道，我叫万俟辰。啊，我死了我死了，我真的死了……”叫万俟辰的胖子捂着自己的胸口，痴痴的看着前面诸葛明月的背影，还在一直叫嚷着。“白痴，你要不要紧。要紧的话，还是先去医馆。”薛子皓有些担心的问道。“不，我没事，快走！”万俟辰顶着一个大猪头，急吼吼的往前追。诸葛明月这个时候却停住了脚步。她站在那里，打量着眼前这座古朴的大门。白羽学院。这是苍枫城唯一的一所学院。她是诸葛明月，也不是诸葛明月。因为，她并非原来的诸葛明月！发生那样的事后，她莫名其妙的来到了这个未知的世界，莫名其妙的成为了一个贵族家庭的私生女。这个世界最让她震惊的地方，不是人们的穿着，不是国家的政体，而是这个世界的人，拥有神奇的力量。能召唤魔宠！这个世界的所谓武者，有三种主流职业，一是召唤师，而是剑士，三是弓箭手。召唤师是最强大的职业，每个人都向往成为召唤师。一旦成为强大的召唤师，名誉，权利，金钱随之而来。召唤师虽多，但是强大的召唤师却并不多。要成为召唤师，要有强大的精神力，而且参加召唤仪式也只有三次机会。在召唤仪式中，一次也没有召唤出魔宠，那么，这一生都不可能再召唤出来。诸葛明月以前已经参加过两次召唤仪式了，今天是第三次，也是最后一次机会了。若是以前的诸葛明月，也许她今日也会同前两次一样，无法召唤出魔宠。只是，现在的她已经不再是以前的她。诸葛明月明媚的脸上微微一笑，迈开步子进了学院的大门。万俟辰和薛子皓气喘吁吁的追了上来，也进了学院的大门。此时此刻，学院的广场上已经人声鼎沸，热闹不已。在广场的中央，有一个巨大的法阵。那阵法的纹路十分复杂，是学院的校长和几名教师用特殊的材料才构筑而成。今天参加召唤仪式的学生们就要迈进这个阵法，感应魔宠。广场最高的看台上，校长和几位老师已经坐在了那里。诸葛明月没有理会旁边的人惊讶的目光和窃窃私语，无非就是在讨论她今日和往常不同而已。诸葛明月清楚，以往这个学院很多人鄙视她，嘲笑她，却都不敢太过火。不敢正面欺负她，因为，她姓诸葛！即使是私生女，她也是姓诸葛！不理会周围的窃窃私语，她直接走到了今日要参加召唤仪式的位置上去。万俟辰拉着薛子皓往诸葛明月这边凑过来，站在了她的旁边。诸葛明月冷冷的瞥了一眼万俟辰。万俟辰顶着个大猪头，嘿嘿一笑。“怎么，还想挨打？”诸葛明月看着眼前的大猪头，冷冷问道。“是啊。啊啊，不是，当然不是。”万俟辰一见到诸葛明月和他说话，就犯傻的直接应下来。等反应过来急忙否定。“那就死远点。”诸葛明月淡淡的说道。“好。我死远一点点。”万俟辰拉着薛子皓往小心翼翼的往旁边挪了两步。薛子皓嘴角抽搐的快要僵硬了。太丢人了！这个死胖子！诸葛明月眼神如炬，看向那广场中间的法阵，脑海中在不断的回忆召唤魔宠的初级咒语。届时，一旦踏入那个法阵，就必须集中精神，念出咒语，全力感应魔宠。诸葛明月这一次的召唤仪式倘若失败，这一生，都不可能再成为召唤师。－－－－－－题外话－－－－－－开文了，敲锣打鼓~哦也~各位看官，有钱的捧个钱场，没钱的捧个人场。为毛是街头卖艺的感觉……", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/fuheikuangnu-qingchengzhaohuanshi/1.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 1 The domineering Zhuge Mingyue On a wide street in Cangfeng City, two teenagers were walking forward laughing. \"Are you ready for today's summoning ceremony?\" One of the short-haired boys turned to the other person and asked. \"Of course I'm ready! I will definitely summon a very cool magic pet today.\" Another fat boy was gearing up and full of confidence. \"Okay, you must succeed in summoning this time before you can become a junior summoner. What kind of amazing magic pet can you summon?\" The short-haired boy struck mercilessly. \"You guys are so ugly when you talk...\" The fat boy got angry and was about to hit the short-haired boy. He turned around and suddenly exclaimed, \"Hey, look, look, isn't that a chicken coop? It's weird, why is the hair not a chicken coop today?\" \"Hey, it's true.\" The short-haired boy turned around and looked at the girl far behind them, and said in surprise. If I hadn't seen her iconic dusty clothes, I wouldn't have recognized her. The chicken coop they talked about was a girl named Zhuge Mingyue. She is the daughter of the Zhuge family, a noble family in the capital. For some reason, she came to their small town. Although she is said to be a noble, everyone knows that her identity is shady. Because she is the illegitimate daughter of the Zhuge family. The Zhuge family has a century-old tradition and is famous. There have been famous summoners in every dynasty. For such a family, the existence of Zhuge Mingyue is their shame. Therefore, she was sent to school in such a small town. And her qualifications are not good, she is introverted and has low self-esteem. I don’t have any friends in college, and I don’t like to dress up. The Zhuge family only hired two servants to take care of her daily life here. How could those two servants take care of him wholeheartedly? With no one to teach and no one to care about, Zhuge Mingyue went to the academy every day with messy hair. So he was nicknamed Jiwotou. \"Would you like to bet that Jiwotou won't be able to summon a magic pet today?\" The fat boy chuckled and said with gloating. \"It's a bet. I bet she won't be able to summon her even if she dies.\" The short-haired boy snorted. \"Tch, it's boring. There's nothing to bet on. But this is Jiwotou's last chance, right? Is this her third time participating?\" the fat boy frowned as he recalled. \"Yes. In her lifetime, she will never think of summoning a magic pet.\" The short-haired boy shrugged. \"Yes, she can summon a magic pet, unless God is going to kill her.\" The fat boy said with some disdain, \"A bastard is a bastard, and it is different from the people with the authentic blood of the Zhuge family...\" The short-haired boy's expression changed, and he was about to remind the fat boy to calm down, but after all, the other person's surname was Zhuge. Just as he was about to speak, his eyes blurred and a figure flashed past. The short-haired boy stared at the scene in front of him in stunned silence. The chicken coop they were talking about flew up and stomped three meters away from them. He flew up and stepped hard on the face of the fat boy with a pair of feet. The huge momentum came suddenly, kicking the fat boy so hard that his nose was bleeding and he fell to the ground with a thud. Then, Zhuge Mingyue landed gracefully, turned around, and smiled brightly at the short-haired boy. The short-haired boy was stunned for a moment. Is this the usual obedient chicken coop head? Is this it? He wouldn't believe it even if his eyes were blinded! The messy hair is now combed extremely smoothly and draped behind her back, exposing her forehead and eyes. Under the smooth forehead, there is a pair of slender and beautiful eyebrows, and under the eyebrows are the bright eyes that make people's hearts flutter. The flying eyebrows are like brilliant sunshine, making people unable to open their eyes. Her small lips were slightly raised, smiling at him. \"Zhuge, Zhuge Mingyue...\" It took a long time for the short-haired boy to come back to his senses and murmured. Zhuge Mingyue ignored him, but knelt down in front of the fat boy with a sweet smile: \"Fat man, what did you just say about me? Can you repeat it again?\" \"Ah, ah...\" The fat boy looked up and saw this bright face. His nosebleed became more intense after his mind wandered, and he subconsciously answered honestly, \"Say, a bastard is a bastard...\" Idiot! The short-haired boy held his forehead, wanting to faint. \"Oh, that's it.\" Zhuge Mingyue smiled brighter and stood up slowly. \"You, you are Zhuge Mingyue, so you are so beautiful...\" The fat boy did not realize what he was going to face next, but looked at Zhuge Mingyue infatuatedly and murmured. \"Yes, I am Zhuge Mingyue.\" Zhuge Mingyue nodded with a smile. The next moment, his expression changed drastically. He raised his foot and stepped on it! I will trample you fat man to death and turn you into a dead fat man! I hate people calling me a bastard! Trample you to death! \"You dare to say that I am a bastard, go to hell! Go to hell! Go to hell!\" \"Ahhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhh...\" The fat boy was stepped on and rolled around, and then he kept howling. The short-haired boy twitched the corners of his mouth, swallowed hard, and subconsciously took two steps back. It's so terrible, so tragic! Zhuge Mingyue, who usually seems harmless to humans and animals, turns out to be so terrifying when he explodes? ! Also, Fatty, do you want to scream so ecstatically when you get beaten? People who don’t know think what’s wrong with you. After trampling on the people, Zhuge Mingyue put his feet back, looked at the unconscious fat man on the ground, snorted, elegantly smoothed the hair around his ears, turned around, and left. The short-haired boy waited until Zhuge Mingyue had gone far, then he carefully squatted down, reached out and shook the person on the ground: \"Fat man, are you still alive? Are you dead?\" \"...\" The fat man was silent. \"Are you dead? If you die, I will go to your house to announce the funeral and buy a coffin.\" The short-haired boy stretched out his hand and shook the fat man on the ground vigorously. \"I'm dead, I'm really dead...I'm dead...\" The fat man got up with difficulty, looked at Zhuge Mingyue's retreating back, covered his chest, and murmured", "title_en": "Chapter 1"}